rooms_desc ({"You have entered the main hall.It's styled with Oak pannels, soft, subdued lightingand has potted plants tastefully arranged around the room.The parquet on the floor is freshly varnished and adds a homely air to the room.","You have entered the library.             Tall bookshelfs line each of the walls...perhaps you would like to look at some of the booksA dozen books catch your eye.","You have entered the main living area, loud music is playing in the backgroundand a large television takes up the north-western corner of the room.A well stocked bar takes up the entire eastern wall, and a door north leads to the kitchen and a long couch sits in front of the television.","You have entered an orchard.The is a light warm rain falling","You have entered the study; it continues with the oak pannelling and subduedlighting. A large desk fills the East wall and on it seems to be a personalcomputer.        soft music sounds like it is coming from a stereo behind the desk anda small 'IN' tray appears to be full, where as the 'OUT' tray is relativlyempty.","You have entered the bedroom.In the center of the room is a large four-poster bed, and around it lie severalpotted plants. A door leads west onto a balcony and a large bay window letsin the moonlight...an open fire fills the room with warmth and a rug lies before it.","You enter the balcony outside of the bedroom...You first notice that the Alpsare so close that you think that it would take only a short strollthe shiny white peaks.        You hear the wind blowing through the trees and you hear the birds singing, you see that the fence which borders the balcony is made of a darkwood which has been beautifully carved.        There are two cairs, and a table here, prepared a wonderful breakfastin the fresh air.","You are in the kitchen; a large table sits in the middle of the room andthe rest of the kitchen seems devoted to food...on the North wall is the ovenmicrowave and refridgerator.To the east is a darkened area...","You are in a small, dark areaChopin started playing as soon as you entered the room and a small tablewith seating for two lies in the center of the room and is candle-lit.The rest of the room remains hidden in shadow.","You have entered the masters Dojo...here he perfects his martial arts.The floor is made of flat, smooth wood...and the walls are made from white paper on a bamboo frame...Various weapons line the south wall.",})
